    "detailed_description": "This is a horizontal level game with exquisite graphics and clever mechanisms, which cannot be missed by level enthusiasts. By the way, the difficulty of the game is relatively high, suitable for players who enjoy tossing and turning. Confident players can challenge or even accept a 0 error challenge!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThere are multiple trigger hammering devices on site, which can accidentally be hit\uff0cThere are also floating floors that can move. Watch the opportunity and stand up\uff0cWandering monsters, be careful not to touch them\uff0cThere are a lot of mechanisms waiting for you to explore<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFrom the dark dungeon to the open castle, explore the secrets inside the castle, and pass the castle's trials<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThrough numerous difficulties, break through a large number of scene mechanisms<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe monsters are waiting for your visit<br />\r\n<br />\r\nTake the courage and challenge this place!",
